WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.584
There's a war going on right now.

00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:01.876
U.S.

00:00:01.876 --> 00:00:02.836
Defense Secretary

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:05.088
Lloyd Austin is reinforcing U.S.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:06.339
support for Israel

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:09.134
after today's attack by Hamas in Gaza

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:10.218
that has left.

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:12.679
That has killed at least 70 Israelis

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:13.513
so far

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:17.392
and wounded some 985 other Israelis

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:18.977
who are being hospitalized.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.979
Secretary Austin met with top U.S.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:22.272
military officials

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:23.565
just a little while ago,

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.066
including the commander of the U.S.

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:27.193
military's Central Command.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:28.361
Let's get more on

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.738
what's going on right now.

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:30.947
Retired Colonel Cedric

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:32.657
Leighton is joining us.

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:33.533
He's a retired U.S.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.451
Air Force colonel.

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.161
He's a CNN military analyst

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:38.163
and CNN global affairs analyst Kimberly

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:39.789
Dozier is with us as well.

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:41.041
Colonel Leighton,

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.083
what do you think the U.S.

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:44.002
is doing right now to help Israel?

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.670
Because from the president on down,

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.297
there have been very strong statements

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:48.048
of support

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:51.926
for Israel in this war with Hamas.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:52.385
Well, in

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.762
concrete terms, Wolf,

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.638
I will speculate a little bit here.

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:57.974
But the basic things that we end up doing

00:00:57.974 --> 00:00:59.559
are logistical support.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:01.394
If the Israelis needed.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.104
Sometimes they'll be intelligence sharing

00:01:03.104 --> 00:01:04.355
that will take place

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:06.316
and anything that the Israelis

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:08.526
will need in terms of

00:01:08.526 --> 00:01:09.778
even diplomatic efforts

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:10.820
that might be ongoing,

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.447
say, with the Egyptians,

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:13.782
some of the Gulf states.

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:20.413
So a lot of these issues will take

00:01:20.497 --> 00:01:21.664
ready to happen

00:01:21.664 --> 00:01:22.373
to perhaps

00:01:22.373 --> 00:01:24.751
help with the logistics aspects of this.

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.461
And there will be moving things

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:29.464
in perhaps to areas near Israel

00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:30.131
in case

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:30.965
the Israelis need

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:33.968
to have their stockpiles replenished.

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:34.928
Kimberly.

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:37.764
An Israeli IDF military spokesperson

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.182
told me a little while ago

00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:40.934
that fighting is ongoing right

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:41.643
now, still

00:01:41.643 --> 00:01:42.727
ongoing in more than

00:01:42.727 --> 00:01:44.771
20 different locations.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.815
Special forces have been mobilized

00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:48.691
as Israeli civilians are being held

00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:49.901
hostage as well.

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:50.902
That's what he says.

00:01:50.902 --> 00:01:54.197
Just how complicated is this response

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.909
from the Israeli military?

00:01:57.992 --> 00:01:58.827
Complicated.

00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:00.120
And it could

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.788
potentially stretch out for days,

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:02.539
if not weeks.

00:02:02.539 --> 00:02:04.666
Once you have a hostage situation

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:07.043
where militants are barricaded

00:02:07.043 --> 00:02:09.254
with Israeli citizens, civilians,

00:02:09.254 --> 00:02:10.213
not just

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:11.047
some of the troops

00:02:11.047 --> 00:02:14.300
that have reportedly been taken,

00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:16.511
it becomes very difficult

00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:18.221
for the Israeli Defense Forces.

00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:21.516
They've got to move slowly and precisely.

00:02:21.766 --> 00:02:24.936
They're already facing a massive blowback

00:02:24.936 --> 00:02:27.230
of anger from the Israeli people

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:28.565
for missing this

00:02:28.565 --> 00:02:30.066
and for not responding

00:02:30.066 --> 00:02:31.025
quickly enough

00:02:31.025 --> 00:02:32.527
to the attacks in the south.

00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:34.237
That's what I was hearing from

00:02:34.237 --> 00:02:36.281
some former Israeli and U.S.

00:02:36.281 --> 00:02:40.201
officials, that it's not just

00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:44.122
bad, that they've bad leveling, you know,

00:02:44.205 --> 00:02:45.165
almost horrific,

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:45.790
that they

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.000
missed signs

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.919
of this potential complex attack,

00:02:49.919 --> 00:02:52.589
but that when it started happening,

00:02:52.589 --> 00:02:53.548
they didn't respond

00:02:53.548 --> 00:02:56.593
fast enough to catch the militants faster

00:02:56.593 --> 00:02:58.178
and to keep them from infiltrating

00:02:58.178 --> 00:02:59.679
some of these communities.

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:01.389
I think that's why you've seen

00:03:01.389 --> 00:03:04.392
the Israeli prime minister

00:03:04.475 --> 00:03:06.686
call up more reservists

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:07.812
because they're going to have to

00:03:07.812 --> 00:03:09.439
do something pretty dramatic

00:03:09.439 --> 00:03:10.940
to respond to this

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:13.359
and to find all the conspiracies

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:16.654
and how this was plotted and carried out.

00:03:16.654 --> 00:03:18.364
And that likely means

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:20.617
a ground incursion into Gaza.

00:03:20.617 --> 00:03:21.409
That means bringing

00:03:21.409 --> 00:03:22.452
a lot of active duty

00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:26.247
forces to that theater to attack their.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:27.415
Which means they'll need

00:03:27.415 --> 00:03:29.334
reservist troops to backfill them

00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:31.419
and keep the rest of the country secure.

00:03:31.419 --> 00:03:32.378
They certainly will.

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:33.213
Colonel Leighton,

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.839
Israel formally is saying

00:03:34.839 --> 00:03:35.715
that the IDF,

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:37.050
the Israel Defense Forces,

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.761
is preparing for a ground incursion

00:03:39.761 --> 00:03:41.346
into Gaza and that, quote,

00:03:41.346 --> 00:03:43.932
all options are on the table.

00:03:43.932 --> 00:03:47.602
So give us a sense what that looks like.

00:03:47.685 --> 00:03:49.562
To the most likely scenario,

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:49.896
Wolf,

00:03:49.896 --> 00:03:50.772
just like Kimberly

00:03:50.772 --> 00:03:51.981
mentioned, is the ground

00:03:51.981 --> 00:03:54.108
incursion into Gaza.

00:03:54.108 --> 00:03:55.818
That's going to be a really, really

00:03:55.818 --> 00:03:57.695
tough thing for the Israelis to do.

00:03:57.695 --> 00:03:59.322
They have done it before,

00:03:59.322 --> 00:04:00.865
but this is urban warfare

00:04:00.865 --> 00:04:04.160
and Gaza is the most crowded place

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.745
they think now on the face of the earth

00:04:05.745 --> 00:04:07.622
in terms of density of population

00:04:07.622 --> 00:04:08.831
per square mile.

00:04:08.831 --> 00:04:10.500
And given that fact,

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.335
there are a lot of different things

00:04:12.335 --> 00:04:14.170
that they'll have to consider.

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.171
They want to go after

00:04:15.171 --> 00:04:16.214
the military targets,

00:04:16.214 --> 00:04:18.049
in essence, be Hamas targets.

00:04:18.049 --> 00:04:20.468
But there are going to be situations

00:04:20.468 --> 00:04:21.844
where there will probably be

00:04:21.844 --> 00:04:22.929
collateral damage,

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:24.764
in other words, civilian casualties.

00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:25.807
And that's going to make it

00:04:25.807 --> 00:04:27.517
really tough on the Israelis,

00:04:27.517 --> 00:04:29.477
not only from a military standpoint,

00:04:29.477 --> 00:04:31.396
but also from it

00:04:31.396 --> 00:04:33.898
from a public relations standpoint.

00:04:33.898 --> 00:04:34.482
The other thing

00:04:34.482 --> 00:04:35.733
of course, that they're going to do

00:04:35.733 --> 00:04:37.110
is they're going to use airpower

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.903
to go after these areas.

00:04:38.903 --> 00:04:40.905
There's already been some of that

00:04:40.905 --> 00:04:42.657
that we've seen around Gaza.

00:04:42.657 --> 00:04:45.326
But I think the bombing attacks

00:04:45.326 --> 00:04:46.786
are going to be more intense

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:48.621
and they're also going to try to cut off

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:50.123
any more Hamas fighters

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:52.500
from coming into Israel itself.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:53.001
So that,

00:04:53.001 --> 00:04:54.460
I think, is what things will look like,

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.796
at least for the next 24 or so hours.

00:04:56.796 --> 00:04:57.714
And, Kimberly,

00:04:57.714 --> 00:04:59.340
what is Israel watching right now

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:00.091
when it comes

00:05:00.091 --> 00:05:01.384
first to the West Bank

00:05:01.384 --> 00:05:02.802
and then up north,

00:05:02.802 --> 00:05:05.596
the border with Lebanon?

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:06.764
Well, they're watching

00:05:06.764 --> 00:05:09.559
for basically all their other opponents

00:05:09.559 --> 00:05:10.518
for two things.

00:05:10.518 --> 00:05:13.730
Any attacks from Iranian allies

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:15.481
in the so-called ring of fire,

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:17.025
which is how Israel describes

00:05:17.025 --> 00:05:18.818
the enemies that ring it.

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:20.320
Hezbollah

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.447
in southern Lebanon

00:05:22.447 --> 00:05:24.574
and the militants in Syria,

00:05:24.574 --> 00:05:26.743
both of whom have stockpiled

00:05:26.743 --> 00:05:28.119
rocket missiles.

00:05:28.119 --> 00:05:28.828
The Hezbollah

00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:32.540
missiles are said to be more than 100,000

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.793
and that can reach most of Israel.

00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:37.420
Also, they'll be watching

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:37.962
the Israeli

00:05:37.962 --> 00:05:38.671
Defense Forces

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:42.884
will be watching for this attack to spark

00:05:42.884 --> 00:05:45.053
some sort of popular revolt

00:05:45.053 --> 00:05:47.055
inside the West Bank.

00:05:47.055 --> 00:05:48.306
In the last two

00:05:48.306 --> 00:05:50.266
uprisings, the last two intifadas,

00:05:50.266 --> 00:05:51.642
the one in the late eighties,

00:05:51.642 --> 00:05:54.645
and then the one in the nineties.

00:05:54.729 --> 00:05:56.397
The first one got sparked

00:05:56.397 --> 00:05:58.107
from a car accident.

00:05:58.107 --> 00:06:01.152
Two truckloads of Palestinian workers

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:03.279
were hit, many killed.

00:06:03.279 --> 00:06:04.614
And that sparked off

00:06:04.614 --> 00:06:05.865
the popular protests

00:06:05.865 --> 00:06:09.243
that then militants took advantage of.

00:06:09.327 --> 00:06:11.079
In this case, they're likely

00:06:11.079 --> 00:06:11.954
they're trying to do it

00:06:11.954 --> 00:06:12.955
the other way around.

00:06:12.955 --> 00:06:15.583
They're staging a big splashy attack

00:06:15.583 --> 00:06:18.628
and calling on others to pick up weapons

00:06:18.628 --> 00:06:21.130
and attack Israelis wherever they are.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:24.133
The second intifada started after

00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:27.011
Ariel Sharon, the Israeli leader,

00:06:27.011 --> 00:06:29.472
then visited the Al-Aqsa mosque

00:06:29.472 --> 00:06:30.390
on what Jews call

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:31.265
the Temple Mount,

00:06:31.265 --> 00:06:34.644
a sacred area to Jews and Muslims

00:06:34.727 --> 00:06:36.646
in the old city.

00:06:36.646 --> 00:06:39.941
The Hamas military leader did say that

00:06:39.941 --> 00:06:43.486
this latest attack was partly because

00:06:43.736 --> 00:06:45.196
of recent incursions

00:06:45.196 --> 00:06:48.157
by Israeli ultranationalists

00:06:48.157 --> 00:06:51.744
into the mosque part of this sacred area,

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.579
which has made major headlines

00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:55.206
across the Arab world, though

00:06:55.206 --> 00:06:57.375
it hasn't been covered much in the West.

00:06:57.375 --> 00:06:58.876
So from their perspective,

00:06:58.876 --> 00:07:00.211
they have cause

00:07:00.211 --> 00:07:02.922
and they're hoping other Palestinians,

00:07:02.922 --> 00:07:04.215
ordinary people,

00:07:04.215 --> 00:07:09.303
will pick up that cause and attack.

00:07:09.387 --> 00:07:09.762
Kimberly

00:07:09.762 --> 00:07:11.556
Dozier and Colonel Cedric Leighton, guys,

00:07:11.556 --> 00:07:13.099
thank you very, very much.

